  "notes_en": [
    "`lines` maps a source line number in the numbered enriched text to the scanned page it was read from. Every claim carries cited_lines, so this is the general way to reach a page image from any claim.",
    "`markers[*].y_frac` is a fraction of page height and is present only where the paragraph's own line was located on the scan.",
    "`generated_at` is the newest modification time of the inputs, not the time of the run, so two runs over the same inputs produce the same bytes."
  ]
